      "attractionGuide": {
        "headline": "Stand inside one of modern Scottish art’s defining coastal landscapes",
        "intro": "Walk carefully from South Row towards the harbour and compare the cliff, pier, rocks and weather with Eardley’s Catterline works. This is a living residential village and working coastal edge, not an open-air museum.",
