          "Joan Eardley",
          "Fishing villages",
          "Coastal scenery",
          "Photography"
        ],
        "parking": "Catterline is absent from the council’s current car-park directory, so no official capacity, tariff, accessible-bay count or payment method can be claimed. Use only clearly signed public parking and never obstruct residents, harbour access or emergency routes; the Creel Inn describes its own parking as very limited.",
        "toilets": "Catterline is absent from the council’s current public-toilet and comfort-partnership directory. Do not rely on a public facility; customer toilets at the Creel Inn are for its patrons during opening hours.",
        "food": [
          {
            "name": "The Creel Inn & Grill",
